[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9301.63, "timestamp": "02:35:01", "text": "某些声音配上某些面孔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9305.83, "timestamp": "02:35:05", "text": "是的。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9307.51, "timestamp": "02:35:07", "text": "我想认识很多人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9309.59, "timestamp": "02:35:09", "text": "社区也是如此，我希望像我一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9323.429, "timestamp": "02:35:23", "text": "永远。我注意到你有个Twitch账号。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9325.59, "timestamp": "02:35:25", "text": "渠道。你会进行多平台直播吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9327.83, "timestamp": "02:35:27", "text": "未来？眨眼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9330.23, "timestamp": "02:35:30", "text": "我的意思是，如果我想的话我可以做到，但我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9333.11, "timestamp": "02:35:33", "text": "现在我觉得YouTube本身就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9335.429, "timestamp": "02:35:35", "text": "我开始玩弄它，但我还没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9337.67, "timestamp": "02:35:37", "text": "我也没做Instagram上那些事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9340.63, "timestamp": "02:35:40", "text": "所以我觉得它就像是……它是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9343.349, "timestamp": "02:35:43", "text": "对我来说，跳槽到Twitch平台也算公平吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9345.91, "timestamp": "02:35:45", "text": "嗯，但我主要做的是像什么一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9348.66, "timestamp": "02:35:48", "text": "它用来观看我朋友们的节目。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9351.67, "timestamp": "02:35:51", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9356.349, "timestamp": "02:35:56", "text": "是的。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9359.91, "timestamp": "02:35:59", "text": "挺好的，我当时就想，呃，就像"}]